# Cloudflare Worker runtime vars for local preview (`pnpm preview` -> wrangler dev).
# Copy to .dev.vars:  cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# This site has no server-side secrets or database. SITE_URL is read only at
# build time by next-sitemap (via .env / the CI env), not at Worker runtime, so
# there are no values to populate here yet. Add server-side secrets here when
# the app gains a backend, then push them with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.